          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "поляна (polyána) — \"a clearing, a glade\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "На поляне мы увидели оленя. Na polyáne my uvídeli olénya. We saw a deer in the clearing."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine. Built on поле — a field."
