              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "На опушке леса стоит маленький дом. Na opúshke lésa stoít málenkiy dom. There is a small house at the edge of the forest."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine. На опушке — at the forest edge."
